### Snapshot Configuration

**Snapshot Strategy for Performance:**

```csharp
using Marten.Events;
using Marten.Events.Aggregation;

// Configure snapshot in Program.cs
builder.Services.AddMarten(options =>
{
    // Enable snapshots for specific aggregate types
    options.Events.UseAggregatorLookup(AggregationLookup.UsePublicAndPrivateConstructors);

    // Snapshot every 50 events
    options.Events.Snapshot<Claim>(SnapshotLifecycle.Every(50));
});
```

**Manual Snapshot Implementation:**

```csharp
using Marten;

public class ClaimSnapshotService
{
    private readonly IDocumentStore _store;

    public ClaimSnapshotService(IDocumentStore store)
    {
        _store = store;
    }

    public async Task CreateSnapshotAsync(Guid claimId)
    {
        await using var session = _store.LightweightSession();

        // Load aggregate from events
        var claim = await session.Events.AggregateStreamAsync<Claim>(claimId);

        if (claim != null)
        {
            // Store snapshot
            await session.Events.SnapshotAsync<Claim>(claimId);
            await session.SaveChangesAsync();
        }
    }
}
```

